<div id="glossPop" class="popup"><button onclick="closePop('glossPop')">Close</button><h3>Glossary - SMS 3220</h3><p><b>Life Insurance:</b> pays on death or survival. <b>Sum Assured:</b> amount paid on claim. <b>Beneficiary:</b> person who receives money. <b>Term Assurance:</b> cover for fixed years, no payout if survive. <b>Whole Life:</b> cover for whole life. <b>Endowment:</b> pays on death or if survive to end. <b>Annuity:</b> regular income in retirement. <b>Life Table:</b> table of lx, dx, qx by age. <b>Underwriting:</b> checking health / risk before accepting. <b>Reserve:</b> money set aside for future claims.</p></div>
