<h2>Topic 6: Group Life, Pensions and Regulation</h2><p><b>Estimated time:</b> ~30 minutes | <b>Objectives:</b> Explain group life, explain pension, explain regulation and IRA.</p>
<p>Group life covers many people under one policy, e.g. all employees of a company. Pension pays income in retirement.</p><div class='keybox'><p><b>Group life:</b> Employer pays premium, employees are covered, cheaper per person, no medical for each person if group is large.</p><p><b>Pension:</b> You contribute while working, fund invests, you receive annuity / lump sum in retirement.</p><p><b>Regulation:</b> IRA licenses life insurers, checks reserves, protects policyholders. Without regulation, an insurer could take premiums and fail.</p></div>
